{"sha": "e8eca59cb98414e7240527f405e2e0e86b3c5140dad06b192844d1afc532ecfe", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "由 $\\dd F$ 得麦克斯韦关系，其余为代入。其微观起源是", "\\cref{ch:b2:particle-diffusion}中的随机游走：", "由 $N$ 个长度为 $a$ 的链段组成的链，其端到端距离", "服从方差为 $Na^2$ 的高斯分布，故伸长 $L$ 时的构型数", "为 $\\Omega \\propto \\eu^{-L^2/2Na^2}$，$S = S_0 -", "k_BL^2/2Na^2$，$f = k_BTL/Na^2$：一根劲度系数", "\\emph{与温度成正比}的弹簧。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.2cm, height=4.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=400, ymin=0, ymax=1.25,", "    xlabel={$T$ (\\unit{K})}, ylabel={$f$ (任意单位)}, xtick={100,200,300}, ytick=\\empty, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:380] {x/300};", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:380] {0.6*x/300};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:300,1.05) {$L - L_0$ 较大};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:300,0.5) {较小};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:120,1.1) {橡胶：$f \\propto T$};", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.2cm, height=4.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=400, ymin=0, ymax=1.25, xshift=6.6cm,", "    xlabel={$T$ (\\unit{K})}, ylabel={$f$ (任意单位)}, xtick={100,200,300}, ytick=\\empty, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=0:380] {1.0-0.0004*x};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=0:380] {0.6-0.00024*x};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:200,1.15) {钢：$f$ 几乎与 $T$ 无关};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 固定伸长量下张力随温度的变化。左：橡胶，", "$f \\propto T$ --- 张力是熵致的，$(\\partial f/\\partial T)_L > 0$，", "拉伸使熵降低，橡皮带升温。右：钢制", "弹簧，其张力来自键能，", "随金属变软而略有下降。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{两相平衡}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[共存条件]\\label{thm:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:coexistence}", "纯物质在固定 $T$ 与 $P$ 下分为两相，质量分别为", "$m_1$、$m_2$，单位质量自由焓分别为 $g_1(T,P)$，", "$g_2(T,P)$，则 $G = m_1g_1 + m_2g_2$；平衡时 $G$ 取最小值，于是", "\\begin{itemize}", "\\item 若 $g_1 < g_2$，则全部物质进入相 1（稳定相", "      是 $g$ \\emph{较低}者）；", "\\item 两相共存仅当", "      \\[", "      g_1(T,P) = g_2(T,P) ,", "      \\]", "      这是 $T$ 与 $P$ 之间的关系，即相图中的", "      共存曲线。", "\\end{itemize}", "沿该曲线（克拉珀龙）有", "\\[", "\\frac{\\dd P}{\\dd T} = \\frac{s_2 - s_1}{v_2 - v_1} = \\frac{L_{1\\to2}}{T\\,(v_2 - v_1)} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\dd G = (g_1 - g_2)\\dd m_1$ 在固定 $T$、$P$（$m_1 + m_2$ 固定）下：", "$G$ 随质量向 $g$ 较低的相转移而减小，直至该相", "独占全部物质，或直至 $g_1 = g_2$。沿曲线对 $g_1 = g_2$ 求微分，", "并对每一相使用 $\\dd g = -s\\,\\dd T + v\\,\\dd P$：$-s_1\\dd T +", "v_1\\dd P = -s_2\\dd T + v_2\\dd P$；且 $s_2 - s_1 = L/T$，因为", "固定 $T$、$P$ 下的相变是可逆的。本科一年级分册中", "用卡诺循环导出了此式；这里它由 $G$ 直接得出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=5cm, xmin=0, xmax=10, ymin=-4.6, ymax=1.2,", "    xlabel={$T$}, ylabel={$g$}, xtick=\\empty, ytick=\\empty, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=0:10] {0.6-0.18*x};", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:10] {1.0-0.30*x};", "    \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:10] {3.0-0.70*x};", "    \\draw[dashed, gray] (axis cs:3.33,0.9) -- (axis cs:3.33,-1.0);", "    \\draw[dashed, gray] (axis cs:5.0,0.9) -- (axis cs:5.0,-1.2);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, below] at (axis cs:3.33,-1.0) {$T_{\\text{熔}}$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, below] at (axis cs:5.0,-1.2) {$T_{\\text{汽}}$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omExo, anchor=west] at (axis cs:8.2,-0.6) {固体};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:8.2,-1.6) {液体};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm, anchor=west] at (axis cs:8.2,-3.5) {气体};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:3.0,-3.9) {斜率 $= -s$：气体最陡};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 固定压强下三相单位质量的自由焓：各相随温度下降，斜率为 $-s$，", "气体最快；稳定相是最低的那条线，相变发生在", "两线相交处。相交点之后的上支为", "亚稳态", "（过冷液体、过热液体）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[水：斜率与亚稳态]\\label{ex:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:water}", "熔化：$L = \\qty{334}{kJ/kg}$，$v_{\\text{液}} - v_{\\text{冰}} = -\\qty{9.1e-5}{m^3/kg}$：", "$\\dd P/\\dd T = \\qty{-1.3e7}{Pa/K}$，\\emph{负} --- 冰在压强下熔化，", "但每开尔文只需 \\qty{130}{bar}：滑冰者的 \\qty{70}{bar} 压强", "只能使熔点降低半度（滑冰靠摩擦力与", "预熔表层实现），而位于三", "千米冰盖之下的 \\qty{270}{bar} 压强使其底部熔化，冰盖得以滑动。汽化在", "\\qty{100}{\\celsius}：$L = \\qty{2.26}{MJ/kg}$，$\\Delta v = \\qty{1.67}{m^3/kg}$：", "\\qty{3.6}{kPa/K} --- 山上 \\qty{0.7}{bar} 时沸点为 \\qty{92}{\\celsius}，", "高压锅中 \\qty{2}{bar} 时为 \\qty{120}{\\celsius}。低于", "\\qty{0}{\\celsius} 时，液态水满足 $g_{\\text{液}} - g_{\\text{冰}} \\approx", "(L/T_{\\text{熔}})(T_{\\text{熔}} - T) = \\qty{1.2}{kJ/kg}$，即每过冷一开尔文", "过冷的液态水处于亚稳态而非不稳定态，云中的纯水滴", "因缺少凝结核而保持液态，可低至 \\qty{-40}{\\celsius}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.4cm, height=5cm, xmin=0.3, xmax=3.2, ymin=0, ymax=1.6,", "    xlabel={$v$}, ylabel={$P$}, xtick=\\empty, ytick=\\empty]", "    % vdW-like isotherm below Tc (schematic): P = 8T/(3v-1) - 3/v^2 with T=0.9 in reduced units, v from 0.45..3.2", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.5:3.2, samples=200] {8*0.9/(3*x-1) - 3/(x*x)};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, dashed, domain=0.45:3.2] {0.647};", "    \\addplot[draw=none, fill=omExo!25, opacity=0.6] coordinates {(0.603,0.647) (0.603,0.647) (0.616,0.586) (0.628,0.539) (0.640,0.502) (0.652,0.474) (0.664,0.453) (0.676,0.439) (0.689,0.429) (0.701,0.423) (0.713,0.420) (0.725,0.420) (0.737,0.422) (0.750,0.426) (0.762,0.432) (0.774,0.439) (0.786,0.446) (0.798,0.454) (0.810,0.463) (0.823,0.472) (0.835,0.481) (0.847,0.491) (0.859,0.500) (0.871,0.510) (0.884,0.519) (0.896,0.528) (0.908,0.537) (0.920,0.547) (0.932,0.555) (0.944,0.564) (0.957,0.572) (0.969,0.580) (0.981,0.588) (0.993,0.596) (1.005,0.603) (1.017,0.610) (1.030,0.617) (1.042,0.624) (1.054,0.630) (1.066,0.636) (1.078,0.642) (1.091,0.647) (1.091,0.647)};", "    \\addplot[draw=none, fill=omExo!25, opacity=0.6] coordinates {(1.091,0.647) (1.091,0.647) (1.112,0.656) (1.132,0.664) (1.153,0.672) (1.174,0.678) (1.195,0.685) (1.216,0.690) (1.237,0.695) (1.258,0.700) (1.279,0.704) (1.300,0.708) (1.321,0.711) (1.342,0.714) (1.363,0.716) (1.384,0.7